# test-utils/

Dev-only Rust library providing shared test fixtures and OAuth2 client utilities for Udex integration tests. Exports functions for secret binding, Hydra endpoint resolution, and OAuth2 client registration via ORY Hydra.

## Dirs

- `src/` -- Rust library implementation with public API for secret handling and Hydra client management

## Files

- `Cargo.toml` -- Package manifest with dev-only flag; dependencies on secrets-rs, dotenvy, and ory-hydra-client
- `README.md` -- Usage documentation and function exports reference
